  {
    "page_content": "Approval must be documented and retained in the order file.\n4. Order Backlog Management\n4.1 Review Frequency\nOrder Backlog is reviewed on a quarterly basis by the Finance team.\n4.2 Aging Calculation\nAging (Days) = Current Date - Original Order Booking Date\n4.3 Flagging Criteria\nBacklog items shall be flagged for review when:\n- Aging (Days) > 365 days (12 months), AND\n- No delivery milestone has been recorded in the system\nFlagged items require Finance Manager review to determine whether continued recognition remains appropriate.\n5. Roles and Responsibilities",
